{"ref":"BDB, שִׁשִּׁי","hw":"שִׁשִּׁי","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁשִּׁי</span></big>  <strong>m.</strong><sub>22</sub> <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁשִׁית</span> <strong>f.</strong><sub>6</sub> <strong>adj.num. ordin. sixth</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">(הַ)יוֹם הַשִּׁשִּׁי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:31\" href=\"/Genesis.1.31\">Gn 1:31</a> + 5 times, etc.; <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּשָּׁנָה הַשִּׁשִּׁית</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:21\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.21\">Lv 25:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.1\">Ez 8:1</a>, etc.; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁשִּׁית הַהִין</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 4:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.4.11\">Ez 4:11</a> <em>6th part of the hin</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.13\">45:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46.14\">46:14</a>; read <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> also <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.13\">45:13b</a> (v. [<a data-ref=\"BDB, שִׁשָּׁה\" href=\"/BDB,_שִׁשָּׁה\", dir=\"rtl\">שִׁשָּׁה</a>] infra).","next":"BDB, שִׁשִּׁים","prev":"BDB, שֵׁשׁ"}